  "description": "Parking €75 per month if required.\r\n\r\nDiscover modern living in the heart of Dublin’s vibrant Docklands at The Benson, Britain Quay, Dublin 2. These beautifully designed 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments combine elegant interiors, high-spec finishes, and stunning city views.\r\n\r\nApartment Highlights:\r\n• Spacious, light-filled interiors with floor-to-ceiling glazing\r\n• Graphite matt kitchens with premium Miele appliances\r\n• Stylish bathrooms with rainfall showers and contemporary finishes\r\n• Private balconies or terraces for outdoor living\r\n• Utility rooms with washer/dryer and ample storage\r\n• A-rated energy efficiency with heat recovery ventilation\r\n\r\nExclusive Resident Amenities:\r\n• Concierge service & parcel collection\r\n• Business centre and co-working spaces\r\n• Rooftop sun terrace with panoramic views\r\n• Secure basement parking & bicycle storage\r\n• Pet-friendly community\r\nLocation Perks:\r\n• Situated in Dublin’s Docklands, steps from tech and financial hubs\r\n• Short walk to Grand Canal Dock, theatres, cafés, and restaurants\r\n• Excellent transport links: Luas, DART, and bus routes nearby",
